      "annotation_text": "Footnote not printed in the source (Table 9 prints only footnotes 1-3). Table 9 is the Extended-Visit-Cycle variant of the Main Study, this corresponds to Table 7 (Main Study) footnote 26: \"Every 90 days following study treatment discontinuation.\" Mapping confirmed by clinical review (2026-08-15): §7.4.4: \"Assessment of next subsequent anticancer therapies will be assessed every 90 days (± 28 days) following study treatment discontinuation visit.\"",
