      "annotation_type": "footnote",
      "annotation_text": "Footnote not printed in the source (Table 9 prints only footnotes 1-3). Table 9 is the Extended-Visit-Cycle variant of the Main Study, this corresponds to Table 7 (Main Study) footnote 27: \"In addition to survival, this assessment includes outcomes for subsequent anticancer therapies including any new malignancy information.\" Mapping confirmed by clinical review (2026-08-15): §7.4.4: survival status every 90 days (± 28 days) post-discontinuation; \"New malignancy information will also be collected as part of this assessment.\"",
